flowchart TD
  accTitle: Illustrative controlled action
  accDescr: A proposed action goes through operation validation, policy and required approval. Denial produces no effect. An allowed effect needs readback before the supported result is recorded.
  A["Agent proposes an action"] --> B["Validate operation and context"]
  B --> C{"Policy and required approval satisfied?"}
  C -->|"No"| N["No effect; record the denial"]
  C -->|"Yes"| D["Trusted binding performs the effect"]
  D --> E["Read back the resulting state"]
  E --> F["Record the supported result"]
